<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>stupidhead</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">yustyna</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5CcGu19vM6KONpXTyn44zd</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.760" end="00:14.020">Fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.020" end="00:19.450">Put your lips all over me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.450" end="00:24.750">Girl, you fuck me like a porn star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.750" end="00:30.080">What's the chance to take her home?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.080" end="00:35.470">You may find it hard to breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.470" end="00:40.360">It's my world but you can co-star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.360" end="00:44.070">Yeah, yeah-yeah-yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.070" end="00:47.960" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Just another lovely night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.960" end="00:52.620" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Trippin' on my different time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.620" end="00:57.310">Sing me to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.310" end="01:02.450">Rest your stupid head on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.450" end="01:07.940">Stupid 'cause you fell for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.940" end="01:10.910">I think that you're the girl of my dreams (oh-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.910" end="01:13.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.580" end="01:17.860">Oh-oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.860" end="01:23.190">She looked down when she was here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.190" end="01:30.920">Why aren't you jealous of the ones that I fuck?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.920" end="01:34.280">Oh-oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.280" end="01:39.230">And that dress, I don't agree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.230" end="01:46.080">Why don't you take a shot of something strong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.080" end="01:50.750">And sing me to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.750" end="01:55.930">Rest your stupid head on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.930" end="02:01.470">Stupid 'causе you fell for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.470" end="02:07.490">I think that you're thе girl of my dreams (oh-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.490" end="02:15.490" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.380" end="02:24.250" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(It's just another lovely night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.250" end="02:29.260" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Trippin' on my different time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.260" end="02:30.760">Please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.670" end="02:33.670" /></div></body></tt>